        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mufitu kawena wikalaku kabidi ha buloba buakadi ne kanyinganyinga diambedi. Mu tshikondo tshia diambedi yeye wakafuisha buloba bua Zebulona ne buloba bua Nafatale bundu, kadi mu matuku atshidi alua neavuishe butumbi kudi buloba budi mu nshila udi uyila ku mai manene, budi dishiya dia Yadene, Galela wa munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu.",
